🌍 Applications
Smart home automation
Temperature-based cooling systems
Server room monitoring
Industrial thermal control
🎯 Conclusion

This project demonstrates a simple yet effective real-time embedded automation system where sensor data is used to control hardware, improving energy efficiency and reducing manual intervention.
